{#-
  SiteFooter (HANDOFF §5, board SiteFooter.dc.html). Shown on every page,
  Getting urgent help included (project lead, 2026-11-07; the board for that
  page has none).

  "Send feedback" (SPEC §13) appears while features.feedback is exactly true.
  It is a link to the Contact page. On pages with the feedback dialog
  (base.njk), src/js/feedback.js swaps it for a button of the same look that
  opens the dialog; without JavaScript, if the script fails, and on pages
  without the dialog (the 404 page), it stays the link.

  Secondary text is paper rather than the board's on-teal-muted: tokens.json
  lists on-teal-muted only on deep-teal and night-teal, not on ink.

  The wording is in `footer` in site.config.json (SPEC §11): the tagline, the
  Acknowledgement of Country, the trial registration and ethics approval
  numbers, and what the content licence excludes. An empty acknowledgement,
  registration or ethics value is left out. The bottom row states the content licence
  (SPEC §22; LICENSE-CONTENT.md): "Content is licensed under CC BY 4.0" and
  its link stay here, with rel="noreferrer" (SPEC §16.1), and the
  exclusions follow after a comma; the template adds the full stop.
-#}
{%- set f = site.footer -%}
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer__inner container">
    <div class="site-footer__top">
      <div class="site-footer__about">
        <p class="site-footer__name">{{ site.siteName }}</p>
        <p class="site-footer__tagline">{{ f.tagline }}</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="site-footer__col" aria-label="Footer">
        <ul role="list">
          {%- for item in [
            { href: '/start/', label: 'Start here' },
            { href: '/#sleep-problems', label: 'Sleep problems' },
            { href: '/about/', label: 'About' },
            { href: '/contact/', label: 'Contact' }
          ] %}
          <li><a href="{{ item.href }}"{{ page.url | ariaCurrent(item.href) | safe }}>{{ item.label }}</a></li>
          {%- endfor %}
          {%- if site.features.feedback === true %}
          <li><a class="site-footer__feedback" href="/contact/" data-feedback-trigger>Send feedback</a></li>
          {%- endif %}
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <nav class="site-footer__col" aria-label="Help and policies">
        <ul role="list">
          <li><a href="/help/"{{ page.url | ariaCurrent('/help/') | safe }}>Referral info</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/"{{ page.url | ariaCurrent('/privacy/') | safe }}>Privacy and your data</a></li>
          <li><a class="site-footer__urgent" href="/urgent-help/"{{ page.url | ariaCurrent('/urgent-help/') | safe }}>Get urgent help</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="site-footer__meta">
      {%- if f.acknowledgement %}
      <p>{{ f.acknowledgement }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if f.trialRegistration or f.ethicsApproval %}
      <p>{{ f.trialRegistration }}{% if f.trialRegistration and f.ethicsApproval %} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {% endif %}{{ f.ethicsApproval }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="site-footer__licence">Content is licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="noreferrer">CC BY 4.0</a>{% if f.licenceExceptions %}, {{ f.licenceExceptions }}{% endif %}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
